member.summary:
The target matrix uses a default or normal type of relationship with a robot.
To convert world coordinates to TargetMatrix use:
    var relative_coordinates_matrix = MotionTarget.WorldBaseMatrix2.Inverse() * world_coordinates_matrix;
    MotionTarget.TargetMatrix = relative_coordinates_matrix;
